[{"title":"村居书怀","author":"李符","text":"欲采梅花酿麴尘，闭门日日醉青春。\n中怀挟策偏违俗，右臂佣书不救贫。\n解事园丁教种树，能言笼鸟报来宾。\n买山未定何山好，村屋年年托此身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7953,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"翻书","author":"曹钊","text":"闭门却尘虑，翻书觅韵题。\n晚云斜挂树，秋雨乱鸣溪。\n得失应无碍，穷通未可齐。\n竹鸡何所慕，恰恰向人啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7954,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"指月庵","author":"曹钊","text":"地偏少迹少，屋对乱峰开。\n月放千岩雪，松喧万壑雷。\n诵经驯虎至，洗钵豢龙来。\n引兴随高衲，长歌日几回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7955,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"霜华","author":"曹钊","text":"霜华历历下庭柯，坐久幽窗暗薜萝。\n风雨惯能欺客枕，烟霞端不负渔蓑。\n间情赋罢人思酒，短札裁成雁渡河。\n满目征尘何日息，邯郸道上塞云多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7956,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟中","author":"曹鈖","text":"晴日动林皋，渔人荡轻橹。\n扁舟随意放，岩花齐欲吐。\n村疏烟火稀，山深树石古。\n远望列群峰，一一青可数。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7957,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔阳道中","author":"曹鈖","text":"平原空怅望，故国已荒丘。\n猎犬穿林出，滩声抱石流。\n月明燕岭暮，霜结蓟门秋。\n尚欲停车问，悲笳动戍楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7958,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"归怀","author":"曹鈖","text":"指顾平原忆旧游，偶然乘兴一登楼。\n萧疏短鬓三年梦，寂寞长江万古愁。\n看世拟逢青眼客，移封愿得醉乡侯。\n西风萧飒吹黄叶，摇落寒林树树秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7959,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再游黄山 其一","author":"曹鈖","text":"三入黄山今又来，诸峰偏向故人开。\n林深夏带高秋气，瀑泻晴喧巨壑雷。\n烟雨半沈舂药井，云霞全护炼丹台。\n莫言竟日无多路，选步应知为惜苔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7960,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再游黄山 其二","author":"曹鈖","text":"水自回环径自分，看山岂惜往来勤。\n烟鬟黯淡将梳雨，石齿崚嶒欲齧云。\n曲邃若非亲阅历，幽奇端不付传闻。\n峰峰千仞堆寒玉，初辟何人运斧斤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7961,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨中对瀑复观龙潭水涨","author":"曹鋡","text":"骤雨划然至，烟雾失长空。\n千峰荡微影，飞瀑垂玲珑。\n深潭忽怒沸，疑是蛟龙宫。\n响声振林樾，雪浪生寒风。\n蹑足心欲动，举首摇双瞳。\n下触石骨碎，上与银河通。\n谁为开凿力，吾将问洪濛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7962,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"伏日同伯兄眉庵松茨消暑","author":"曹鋡","text":"何处携尊酒，东皋旧草堂。\n雨残沙路细，风软药苗香。\n巢燕非时出，山蜂底事忙。\n老亲怜弱稚，欢喜故相将。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7963,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"入山晓行","author":"曹鋡","text":"竹舆随径转，萝薜挂烟霄。\n石险偏横树，溪回屡渡桥。\n雾收方见日，云聚即成潮。\n潇洒红尘外，青山认寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7964,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"入紫翠林","author":"曹鋡","text":"人多穿洞出，路狭碍枯藤。\n怪石如迎客，山猿不避僧。\n疏林飞瀑落，绝壑乱云蒸。\n素有登临兴，梯霞上百层。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7965,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"坐响雪亭","author":"曹鋡","text":"山涌涛千尺，晴堆雪一溪。\n雨随云去住，烟接树高低。\n路尽疑天逼，峰尊与日齐。\n扫苔聊独憩，摩壁好留题。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7966,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登文殊院","author":"曹鋡","text":"嵯岈开线路，杖履莫辞难。\n岚气千岩雨，山风六月寒。\n石欹防客过，松古学龙蟠。\n纵目遐荒外，方知天地宽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7967,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游披霞山","author":"曹钤","text":"落日红云带鸟飞，重来登眺坐松扉。\n秋林寒渚千村晚，山寺无人月送归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7968,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题陈隐士山居","author":"马敬思","text":"羡尔深山静，连宵不掩扉。\n秋潭鹤影瘦，霜草鹿胎肥。\n岁酒先储瓮，园丝半在机。\n此中多隐者，相识姓名稀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7969,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"祝山如席上同钱饮光先生夜话 其一","author":"马敬思","text":"熟读《离骚》夜雨残，床头《周易》共盘桓。\n鹃从蜀破犹称帝，松自秦亡懒署官。\n钵冷瞿昙归后托，诗工摩诘晚年看。\n草堂幽处梅花发，偏与人间斗岁寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7970,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"祝山如席上同钱饮光先生夜话 其二","author":"马敬思","text":"野衲云山隐自招，高僧列传党人谣。\n书中甲子题三径，袖里春秋纪六朝。\n路觅西来传梵铎，禅安东渡挂诗瓢。\n心灰久已同枯井，不逐风波似汐潮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7971,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"得方尔止先生书","author":"马敬思","text":"三载移家桃叶春，钓船烟雨芰荷身。\n他乡白发惊新长，故国青山似旧贫。\n座上曾逢周铁虎，车前犹泣汉铜人。\n南朝多少尊官冢，冷落高低卧石麟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7972,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿僧房即事","author":"马敬思","text":"老僧留我西窗宿，夜劈松薪煮新竹。\n起来云薄晓山青，几处疏烟出茅屋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7973,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀尔升师","author":"马敬思","text":"先生真隐逸，家室未居城。\n世说卿惭长，人称姓不名。\n燕巢茅屋暖，鹤啄芡湖清。\n鱼汊今年好，方舟荡桨行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7974,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宜城即事","author":"马敬思","text":"宜城三万户，十载半凋零。\n画阁移蔬圃，朱门换荻屏。\n烟波当晚碧，汀草出寒青。\n独上江亭望，渔镫乱客星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7975,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙眠山","author":"马孝思","text":"龙眠宜是逃名地，忆昔公麟隐此闲。\n尽有壶觞追北海，不贪仕宦惜南山。\n桃梅逐路争开落，麋鹿亲人共往还。\n春色定知游客遍，风尘怜我滞江关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7976,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游龙眠","author":"马孝思","text":"少保幽栖处，溪边曲径开。\n涧茶留客坐，蔬饭待僧来。\n引水穷泉脉，当山垒月台。\n阶前松柏古，犹望后人培。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7977,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠田琢如","author":"马孝思","text":"四郊鸡犬是秦余，淳朴还推水竹居。\n地僻肯从游子借，径荒先命野人锄。\n瓶封菊蕊冬藏酒，馔入溪头早市鱼。\n天半逢君能爱客，不妨高枕当吾庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7978,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读史","author":"马方思","text":"青鸟西飞汉集灵，柏梁台是望仙亭。\n空劳海上求方士，笑杀金门一岁星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7979,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠医者","author":"马方思","text":"小隐山中采药行，向平五岳未忘情。\n此生不入长安市，女子何从问姓名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7980,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄张山人","author":"马方思","text":"伊人高卧白云阿，衣制芙蓉带女萝。\n老去自伤《别鹄操》，贫来懒逐《饭牛歌》。\n秋前黄发同衰叶，雨后青山守烂柯。\n试问鹿门庞隐士，何如采药市中过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7981,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答王吉人","author":"马方思","text":"小隐无由问起居，仲春始得故人书。\n暂归白社开新径，久羡青山葺旧庐。\n芝草欲成黄绮志，桃花不禁武陵渔。\n相期过从清秋后，词赋奚烦问子虚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7982,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀舍弟执公山中","author":"马国志","text":"送君山中居，忆君山下路。\n此夕独徘徊，凉风起烟树。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7983,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南郊饮陈氏精舍","author":"马国志","text":"水田十亩山人宅，茅屋三间处士家。\n留客共餐篱下笋，呼儿频煮雨前茶。\n绿摇荷盖添新涨，红掩柴门带晚霞。\n自识南塘村外路，莫嫌乘兴就黄花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7984,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓发寄姚彦昭","author":"马国志","text":"酒酣月初堕，梦回天欲曙。\n解缆及秋晴，挂帆向江路。\n揽衣起徬徨，已失维舟处。\n潺潺胥浦流，霭霭吴门树。\n举目得清旷，无言自来去。\n独有索居情，空水隔烟雾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7985,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿白云庵","author":"马国志","text":"不觉看山倦，招提远近探。\n偶寻黄叶路，忽到白云庵。\n拄杖倚寒石，临风对春岚。\n铺床置羹饭，竟夕老僧谈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7986,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"集次典寿香亭对菊限韵","author":"曹爚","text":"雅会杂山农，风流羡仲容。\n秋光成五色，寒影见千重。\n日晚开高阁，村深闻远钟。\n杖头吾未办，率尔一相从。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7987,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郊居","author":"曹煊","text":"旷野风尘隔，柴扉昼不开。\n荷香浮碧水，竹影漾苍苔。\n径有渔樵至，门无车马来。\n悠然情自得，鸥鹭与徘徊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7988,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"佛手柑","author":"张道源","text":"金色曾传授记年，好从清苦味真诠。\n如何有手多相似，不及天龙一指禅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7989,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎阜遣兴 其一","author":"张道深","text":"四月江南晒麦天，日长无事莫高眠。\n好将诗思消愁思，省却山塘买醉钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7990,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎阜遣兴 其二","author":"张道深","text":"千秋霸气已沈浮，银虎何年卧此丘。\n凭吊有时心耳热，云根拨土觅吴钩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7991,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日","author":"盛镜","text":"春日天气佳，好鸟林外鸣。\n即事都无虑，幽居心自清。\n日入农务静，披衣步前楹。\n野老来相过，有酒时一倾。\n遂此生前乐，无为身后名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7992,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙潭石","author":"盛大谟","text":"十月风烟尽，寒潭清我神。\n淋漓蝌蚪字，剥落核桃皴。\n日月劳宾主，溪山递故新。\n渔歌方欸乃，万石自嶙峋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7993,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿驿南","author":"盛乐","text":"停骖问古驿，山色入樵歌。\n惟有客愁远，不堪秋雁过。\n天低云气老，野阔北风多。\n此去柴桑近，东篱今若何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7994,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上韩侯钧台以诗投淮水吊之","author":"盛乐","text":"平台风散晚烟痕，往事悲凉落日昏。\n意气已随飞鸟尽，功名但有钓鱼存。\n汉家草草夷人族，淮水沄沄荡古魂。\n浪迹若非逢漂母，今来何处吊王孙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7995,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送林武宣之楚","author":"曹尔垣","text":"金风秋气肃，霜林翳远道。\n游子辞故乡，登途展遐眺。\n寒烟横苍莽，积翠迷深窅。\n扬帆千里去，云山一何杳。\n江声日夜闻，清猿伤客抱。\n抑郁念伊人，抗情寄物表。\n俯仰今昔间，爰披江蓠草。\n相思秋水清，相见春风杪。\n同心蕙与兰，两地参与昴。\n侧身云梦泽，离怀空缭绕。\n申章托缱绻，意气良自宝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7996,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己酉九日墨林小集","author":"曹尔垓","text":"杖策将登高，高冈隔烟雾。\n风急塞雁哀，骤雨当窗度。\n邀宾水上亭，披襟探毫素。\n图成山吐云，绘出花垂露。\n良辰足欢娱，肯为穷愁误。\n作赋临清流，衔杯对高树。\n红叶影苍茫，黄菊悲迟暮。\n卷帘夜色昏，水田下白鹭。\n未尽茱萸觞，客迷东郭路。\n舟子遥相招，濯锦江头渡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7997,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浒墅关晓行","author":"曹尔垓","text":"吴关迷曙色，已挂一帆风。\n淡月临清霭，平波映碧空。\n鸡鸣茅屋里，人语画船中。\n极目长天望，朝云绕树红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7998,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏门访孙夏峰先生不值","author":"曹尔埏","text":"大雅久沈沦，老成俱寂寞。\n当代仰哲人，此地宗伊洛。\n弱冠扬骏声，幽奥穷坟索。\n文藻丽班扬，风流迈李郭。\n德辉固冲融，高怀复磅礴。\n素履难具陈，古人恨不作。\n岁晚慕隐沦，散发卧丘壑。\n变化叹犹龙，腾骞迅孤鹤。\n讵意动华时，未遂颍箕乐。\n远谢苏门隈，燕蓟暂栖泊。\n山水失主人，孤云将焉托。\n遥望子云亭，松花自开落。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":7999,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"折杨柳","author":"曹尔埴","text":"去年折杨柳，还与君同陌。\n今年折杨柳，关山千里隔。\n思君不可见，攀条长叹息。\n遥遥玉笛吹，总是伤行役。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8000,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"毗陵道中","author":"曹尔埴","text":"两岸暮潮平，风帆一叶轻。\n人烟随日暝，渔火傍沙明。\n纤月流高树，悲笳接废营。\n乡关情更切，回首望孤城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8001,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乌衣巷","author":"冒与晋","text":"门掩斜阳户网尘，乌衣巷改尚逡巡。\n旧时燕子飞还到，莫向堂前认主人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8002,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上巳修禊水绘庵分赋","author":"冒嘉穗","text":"和风荡林樾，霁色摇春岑。\n入门洒飞泉，映水啼幽禽。\n花竹日淡沱，烟景何清深。\n节序一以佳，矧遘瑶华音。\n握兰正婉娩，折柳嗟侵寻。\n且漱溪边石，一听丘中琴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8003,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠柳敬亭并题左宁南军中说剑图","author":"冒丹书","text":"玉帐登坛夜论兵，将军出塞气纵横。\n可怜多少衔恩客，写向丹青只柳生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8004,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同其年看池荷","author":"冒丹书","text":"几折沿堤路，相携坐此中。\n天连千顷碧，花涨一池红。\n欲去已将没，看来意不穷。\n江南有愁客，对此忆吴宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8005,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋兴 其一","author":"冒车书","text":"几缕秋烟一抹霞，空阶凉雨似山家。\n常忧来日不相得，讵是我生真有涯。\n径绕林皋封落叶，宅连雉堞乱归鸦。\n候虫也似知迟暮，鸣过墙阴稨豆花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8006,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋兴 其二","author":"冒车书","text":"?山数叶且留余，犹记成童佩韘初。\n王谢弟兄过络绎，崔卢儿女笑轩渠。\n蓼花水齧中丞墓，柿叶声寒开府墟。\n吏部遗书亦寥落，我姑饱贪到华胥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8007,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日病起","author":"冒汉书","text":"久病卧茅屋，阶前芳草生。\n客多相惜意，鸟作可怜声。\n柳意迟新雨，花心动晓晴。\n江乡烟景好，三载总关情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8008,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋来","author":"冒禹书","text":"忽忽年华伤暮迟，秋来怀抱最相宜。\n感时实下江州泪，触目空多宋玉悲。\n萧瑟荒庭鸣蟋蟀，苍茫远水下鸬鹚。\n寥寥天地吾何托，几度临风有所思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8009,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己卯上巳过顾大念哉","author":"冒殷书","text":"比来才觉负年华，马齿惊心暗暗加。\n百舌尽情啼上巳，东风著力落桃花。\n管弦不结文人社，诗酒聊寻处士家。\n穷日追欢还卜夜，严城何必鼓频挝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8010,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"松下遣怀","author":"彭孙遹","text":"秋意日寥廓，瞑色散微雨。\n高风天外来，吹我孤松树。\n翻然落空翠，澹与云阴互。\n查冥寒涛生，微闻滴香露。\n幽人岩石间，抱此物外慕。\n庶几岁寒心，聊以保迟暮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8011,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨中过白芒村寄高山人俨","author":"彭孙遹","text":"春云生骤寒，溪上无人迹。\n石笋清相罗，烟翠纷可摘。\n欲持三尺绢，写此春山碧。\n却忆山中人，远在龙池宅。\n惆怅不同游，白芒风雨夕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8012,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"野田行","author":"彭孙遹","text":"荒城日落生愁雾，白骨青磷乱无数。\n山河兴废多战场，宿草凄凉泣狐兔。\n悲风瑟瑟起白杨，牛羊成群上古墓。\n人生谅无百岁寿，焉知生乐与死苦。\n朱门华屋未解忧，请君试出野田路。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8013,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"越溪行","author":"彭孙遹","text":"越来溪，公莫渡。\n行人隔水呼唤频，舟子掉头不肯顾。\n波平如掌帆不前，碧湖澄静生寒烟。\n县官封船供应急，经今一月还复然。\n公家用物有定数，民间那得知其故。\n日日官船进女城，依然船数不加盈。\n昨闻大师至，已泊南濠隈。\n太守亲自出，平明骑马来。\n官来犹自可，兵来烈如火。\n弓刀装小舠，人马乘大舸。\n越来溪，公莫渡。\n捉船未已还捉人，劝君漫出城西路。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8014,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"陈白沙草书歌","author":"彭孙遹","text":"白沙先生名早闻，手掷青山归白云。\n陈情上拟李令伯，讲书欲方吴聘君。\n晚年信手作大字，落笔纵横有奇致。\n何必规规王右军，淋漓时复成高寄。\n世人好古如好龙，可怜识见多雷同。\n岂知草圣固余技，相赏不在翰墨中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8015,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西洋琥珀酒船歌","author":"彭孙遹","text":"海外良工擅奇思，酒船制作穷珍异。\n滑稽足傲鸱夷形，淋漓可使淳于醉。\n宛转玲珑二尺长，镂金错采巧莫当。\n文珠作窗玳瑁屋，白银为篷珊瑚樯。\n酌酒五升帆半起，峡船始发春江里。\n引壶注满饱欲张，蓬蓬已可行千里。\n长年三老毛发动，须眉飒飒笑相视。\n绮疏启处中有人，皎若芙蓉照秋水。\n须臾酒竭帆亦收，回看堂上惟虚舟。\n机缄动止那可测，见者疑同神鬼游。\n此器徒闻出西域，估客新从舶中得。\n由来奇巧汩人心，不胫还能走中国。\n对之三叹谢贾胡，匏尊一酌足自娱。\n居奇漫直十家产，适用岂若千金壶。\n投珠抵璧当代事，雕锼无益何为乎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":8016,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]